fixture tech07_coyote_dash_on_cooldown
doc BUILD.md s5 tech 7 coyote dash; s5 Dash "Cooldown 24 f on ground"; docs/adr/0010: in coyote time with the ground dash cooling, a dash press is the air dash at once
room test/cliff
spawn 760 320
frames 50
input
  # A ground dash, then walk off the cliff and press dash while its cooldown still runs.
  0 R dash
  1..12 R
  13 U R dash
  14..49 R
end
expect
  at 0 event.dash=1
  # Fires on the press frame as the 8-way air dash (up-right), spending the air dash.
  at 13 event.dash=1 state=dash air_frames=2 vx=3620 vy=-3620 air_dashes=0
end
